title start
tags: sample first-run
The first sample page
end title

paragraph start
Every line of this page sits inside a named block. A block is three lines of
shape: the name and start, the content on its own line or lines, then end and
the name again.
end paragraph

paragraph start
The code block below holds a line that looks like a start line. The body of a
code block is opaque, so that line is content and opens nothing. Only end code
closes it.
end paragraph

code start
language: text
def example():
    return 1
end code
